[ti:Qelleb lemtel-im]
[ar:Lounès Matoub]
[al:Dda Ḥemmu]
[length:4:17]
[by:Rayane Kch]
[00:00.69] Tullas akk ad am-rewwlent
[00:09.16] D sidna yub ad tuɣaleḍ
[00:17.47] D lmuḥal ad kem-id-qerrbent
[00:26.48] Ssnent-kem qbel ad tbeddleḍ
[00:32.63] Si tala mi ara d-agment
[00:36.71] Ur d-tettedduḑ gar-asent
[00:42.00] Ɣer deffir ad kem-xellfent
[00:45.33] Tasa-m ad tt-tegzem tesmeḍ
[00:48.79]
[00:52.09] Ṛuḥ kker qelleb lemtel-im
[00:57.10] Ma d nekk ur am-id-saḥeɣ ara
[01:02.24] Ur d iyi-ttarra d ccɣel-im
[01:07.59] Asirem-nni n zik yekfa
[01:12.83] Err-as ṛṛezza i wul-im
[01:18.53] Ma bɣant-iyi wallen-im
[01:21.55] Allen-iw ur kem-bɣint ara
[01:26.73] Tuwiḍ abrid n lebɣi-m
[01:31.70] Nekk lǧerḥ-iw d aqdim
[01:34.14] Yuwi-d iqcer dayen iḥla
[01:38.77]
[01:49.12] Zik ɣilleɣ d imawlan-im
[01:54.45] Amer ur d i-nebɣi ara
[01:59.20] Ziɣ temcawareḍ d lebɣi-m
[02:04.41] Akken ad i-d-jabem ssebba
[02:10.12] Kul azniq teldiḍ imi-m
[02:15.23] Tettgallaḍ s lmut-im
[02:18.37] Ur t-uɣeɣ ur yeɣri ara
[02:23.65] Ur teḥjibeḍ lesrar-im
[02:28.35] Ddnub, ttwab i yiri-m
[02:31.54] Ma ffɣent-am tirga mxalfa
[02:35.35]
[02:45.78] Tɛemmdeḍ ad d-ters lmut-im
[02:50.97] Wala zzwaǧ ur d am-nehwi
[02:55.99] Tserseḍ-d deg-i igezzim
[03:00.86] Terniḍ leɛyub ur nelli
[03:06.51] Ass mi ara kem-yezzem wul-im
[03:11.61] Ɣef uḥlalas d-yeffɣen imi-m
[03:14.97] Ad tafeḍ tḍelmeḍ-iyi
[03:20.20] Nndama ad am-tuɣal d aḥkim
[03:24.83] Ad am-tezwi zzin-im
[03:28.04] Ad am-yuɣal d aɛdaw lemri
[03:32.04]
[03:42.38] Ma nfiɣ si taddart ass-a
[03:44.59] Ul-iw am ssmid yufaf
[03:47.35] Ttaṛ-iw yejba-d tura
[03:49.74] Yesseɣres-d lqid s zzɛef
[03:52.56] Ad n-iṛuḥ am usigna
[03:54.34] Fell-am ad n-yebru i lehwa
[03:56.20] Ad d-yeḥyu uẓaṛ n lmeḥna
[03:58.48] Deg-m ad d-yefk ixulaf
[04:00.53]